<translation_old translation_old="And immediately, the abbot ordered that the hair that had grown on his head be sheared off, and prayed for him, and put the hood and the mantle on him, according to Alexandrian custom. When the brothers who were in the monastery heard all these things about Apa Longinus, they considered him most perfect, and began to glorify him more.">
<verse_n_old verse_n_old="9">
