<translation_old translation_old="Within it he was silent, working the ropes, and he exhausted himself through his manual labor so that he might find a way to give to the needy through his manual labor, likening himself through this to the holy apostle Paul, who says, “These hands serve my needs and those who are with me” and “Giving, rather than receiving, is blessedness.”">
