<p_n p_n="20">
<chapter_n chapter_n="20">
<translation_old translation_old="Now it happened one night, as he sat with his disciples meditating on the word of God and doing manual labor, that he fell asleep sitting on his stool where he'd been working, remembering the holy singer David: “I will give no slumber to my eyes, or nodding to my eyelids, or relief to my temples until I find a place for the Lord—a residence for the God of Jacob.”">
