</translation_old>
<translation_old translation_old="For the great trumpet of the prophets rightly called such men deer, since the deer are lovers of the desert and persecute the race of the snakes like enemies. This, too, is how these saints flee from the turmoil of the cities, settling in deserted places, and still persecute the race of intellectual snakes—i.e., the spirits of wickedness—at all times.">
<verse_n_old verse_n_old="5">
