<translation_old translation_old="Apa Longinus had the holy Apa Lucius, in turn, teach himself to make the ropes. And so they continued serving God with great zeal, living together in great peace, each one keeping all his ritual duties in order, so that the reputation of their conduct and of their sober lives filled the great city of Alexandria and all of Egypt.">
<verse_n_old verse_n_old="4">
