<p_n p_n="22">
<chapter_n chapter_n="22">
<translation_old translation_old="Now a woman with a disease in her breast that the physicians called cancer, having heard about the great Apa Longinus and that the Lord performs healings through him, arose with faith and came to him. She had spent all she had on the physicians, and no one had healed her.">
