<translation_old translation_old="Who can tell of the cures and miracles that God performed through him? If I wished to speak about each one of his cures—for the time will let me speak—I would; but, I will mention a few of them, so as to conclude the tale up to this point, regretting that some shall be in disbelief over the multitude of the miracles.">
